# ============================================================
# Employee Management & Compensation Platform — backend env
# Copy this file to `.env` and use as-is for LOCAL development.
# Every value below was generated randomly for local dev only.
# For PRODUCTION, replace every secret with your own and never
# reuse the values shipped in this file (the app refuses them
# when running with the prod profile).
# ============================================================

